  "description": "How We Find Stocks, Like Palantir and Bloom Energy... EARLY",
  "body_html": "<p>Happy Monday, hope you had a relaxing weekend and feeling refreshed for the market open this week. We closed green on Friday, which more often than not, indicates a bullish continuation this week. Lets see how the market handles the weekend news, before sprinting off to buy more stocks. Remember, we do not need to be “first” or get “best price.”</p><p>Which leads me to this video… apologies for baiting the beginning. To be clear, we are <strong>NOT</strong> timing tops or bottoms. Nor do you hear me give “price targets,” an often futile effort and most often wrong. If you do hear me give a price target, you will also hear me say: “take this with a grain of salt.” The point is to get into a winning position, and <em><strong>catch a piece of trend, preferably a strong, momentous trend. </strong></em></p><p>The <strong><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/stocktok-summary-fc6?r=4z8lgl&amp;utm_campaign=post&amp;utm_medium=web\">StockTok Screener</a> </strong>searches for stocks with already established uptrends, with institutional volume pushing in and pivot breakouts from consolidations. When I share a stock, I have also manually reviewed myself. The screener has both a short term (days to weeks) and long term (weeks to months) screener, to accommodate for both short term and long term investors. </p><p>I’ll be available in the <strong><a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/f0cce345-4d01-43b4-87c8-60102042ebb8\">Main Chat</a> </strong>if you have any questions or just want to talk. I’ll have more updates through the week. </p><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/subscribe?\"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p>If you like this content, please be sure to like ❤️ and re-stack. </p><p>Thanks for stopping by! </p><div class=\"captioned-button-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/forget-the-perfect-entry?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CaptionedButtonToDOM\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Know someone interested in investing? Share this with them!</p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/forget-the-perfect-entry?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/forget-the-perfect-entry?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p></div>",
